    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of <a href=\"BeanFactorySessionFactoryLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.lookup\"><code>BeanFactorySessionFactoryLookup</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"BeanFactorySessionFactoryLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.lookup\"><code>BeanFactorySessionFactoryLookup</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations must implement this method to retrieve the <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> identified by the given name from\ntheir backing store.",
      "translation": "实现类必须实现此方法，以从其存储中检索给定名称所标识的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra 中的接口\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use of this constructor is redundant if this object is being created by a Spring IoC container, as the supplied\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> will be replaced by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> that creates it (<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>\ncontract). So only use this constructor if you are using this class outside the context of a Spring IoC container.",
      "translation": "如果此对象是由 Spring IoC 容器创建的，使用此构造函数是多余的，因为提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>将被创建它的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>所替换（<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>契约）。因此，仅当在 Spring IoC 容器上下文之外使用此类时，才应使用此构造函数。",
      "count": 1
    },
